    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file named `query_documents.py` in the current working directory. The file should contain code that queries documents by a field value or partition-style key using a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon DynamoDB as the external provider, which is a fully managed NoSQL database service provided by AWS. The code will include the necessary imports and a function to query documents using the DynamoDB client. </thinking>\n",
